Package: cmf-control
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: JScoder4005 <muk4005@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pyqt6, python3-gi, python3-dbus, bluez
Recommends: playerctl, libqt6imageformats6
Description: Linux companion app for CMF Buds Pro 2
 Native Linux desktop app to control the CMF Buds Pro 2 earbuds:
 battery, noise control, EQ, touch gestures, in-ear detection,
 bass enhancement, sleep timer, RSSI, firmware info, system tray
 and MPRIS now-playing — all over a reverse-engineered RFCOMM
 protocol via BlueZ.
Homepage: https://github.com/JScoder4005/cmf-control
